{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283130","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028313001:2":{"text":"앗! 그쪽은 밟으면 안 돼요! 발자국 남기지 마시고요! 흙을 먼저 깔고, 볏짚과 낙엽을 덮으면... 완벽해요!","source_cn":"哎，别踩那里！不要留下脚印！盖上浮土，铺上草皮和落叶…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41829BFEAEC49406","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028313002:1":{"text":"함정은 주변 환경에 녹아들어야 하는 법이죠. 자연스럽고 진짜 같아야 사냥감이 안심할 거고, 그래야 빈틈도 생길 거예요...","source_cn":"陷阱要和周围的环境融合，逼真且自然，让猎物因安全感而放...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAD90658AB79D3F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028313003:1":{"text":"어때요? 고블린을 잡은 함정에서 많은 것을 배웠어요. 게다가 날이 갈수록 발전하고 있죠!","source_cn":"怎么样？我可是在那个困住咕布林的陷阱上学到了很多新东西...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF596C3255CE0EC60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028313004:1":{"text":"진정한 학자는 어려움이 닥쳐도 지식을 습득하는 법이랍니다.","source_cn":"身陷困境也不忘及汲取知识，这才是真正的学者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A1C212264ADE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028313005:1":{"text":"진정한 학자님, 이 함정은 어떻게 쓰는 건가요?","source_cn":"请问真正的学者先生，这个陷阱要怎么发挥它的作用？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB128E7E8D446223D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028313006:1":{"text":"아주 간단해요. 여러분이 이블 시드를 이곳까지 유인하면 돼요. 겁먹은 이블 시드가 정신없이 도망치다가 함정에 “슉”하고 빠지면 성공이죠!","source_cn":"很简单，你们把魔花种子赶到这里，让它们慌不择路，“噗通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10D638DEC15A4EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028313007:1":{"text":"그냥 그게 끝인가요?","source_cn":"就这样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96EF7D3EB19E7F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028313008:1":{"text":"그럼요! 원래 완벽한 함정일수록 작동법은 간단한 법이에요. 좋은 결과가 있을 거라고 장담해요.","source_cn":"那当然！出色的陷阱往往只需要简单的触发方式，我向你们保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DC3DA881634577D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伽利":{"text":"갈리","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}